<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 309 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 309 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA, India 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were all out for 309 off 49.4 overs against Pakistan in the second of the best-of-three finals in Independence Cup cricket tournament on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
